---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Research | Your Name">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
    <h1>Scientific interests and active work</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      This section organizes my research themes, current projects, and computational methods.
    </p>
    <div class="quick-nav">
      <a href="#themes">Themes</a>
      <a href="#methods">Methods</a>
      <a href="#current-focus">Current focus</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="reading-section" id="themes">
    <article>
      <h2>Research themes</h2>
      <p>Stochastic processes, statistical mechanics, molecular simulation, and scientific computing are the core threads.</p>
      <ul class="muted-list">
        <li>Random walks, Markov processes, and diffusion</li>
        <li>Equilibrium and non-equilibrium statistical models</li>
        <li>Sampling algorithms and numerical experiments</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article id="methods">
      <h2>Computational methods</h2>
      <p>Method development is paired with reproducible workflows and explanatory notes.</p>
      <ul class="muted-list">
        <li><a href="/simulations/">Interactive simulation demos</a></li>
        <li><a href="/computational-notes/">Quarto computational notes</a></li>
        <li><a href="/notes/">Quartz concept network</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article id="current-focus">
      <h2>Current focus</h2>
      <ul class="tag-list">
        <li>Markov chains</li>
        <li>Molecular simulation</li>
        <li>Monte Carlo</li>
        <li>Scientific computing</li>
        <li>Interactive visualization</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
